            1572,
            1099
          ],
          "order": 8,
          "content": "SUBJECT: KENT 80/KS TAR REDUCTION - FINLAND/907"
        },
        {
          "label": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.14583333333333334,
            0.34754797441364604,
            0.29245283018867924,
            0.36612854096862624
          ],
          "bbox_px": [
            371,
            1141,
            744,
            1202
          ],
          "order": 9,
          "content": "Ref S/R 107/82"
        },
        {
          "label": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.14544025157232704,
            0.39141029546146816,
            0.8557389937106918,
            0.45720377703320136
          ],
          "bbox_px": [
            370,
            1285,
            2177,
            1501
          ],
          "order": 10,
          "content": "After evaluations and rejections of tar reduction samples 49B, 50B, and 51B we have reviewed deliveries and designs of several KENT products to find one which meets the 10.0 mg/cig. (DPM) and 0.7 mg/cig. nicotine constraints."
        },
        {
          "label": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.14583333333333334,
            0.46847395674687786,
            0.5094339622641509,
            0.48705452330185806
          ],
          "bbox_px": [
            371,
            1538,
            1296,
            1599
          ],
          "order": 11,
          "content": "We propose the following two trials."
        },
        {
          "label": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.14897798742138366,
            0.4949741090466037,
            0.7558962264150944,
            0.7264696923545537
          ],
          "bbox_px": [
            379,
            1625,
            1923,
            2385
          ],
          "order": null,
          "content": "<table><tr><td></td><td>Trial 1</td><td>Trial 2</td></tr><tr><td>•Blend (%) :</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>MGLF-31</td><td>69.9</td><td>69.9</td></tr><tr><td>Oriental</td><td>10.3</td><td>10.3</td></tr><tr><td>MRT</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td></tr><tr><td>F.C. WTS</td><td>14.8</td><td>19.8</td></tr><tr><td>•Final Casing</td><td>MGE-651</td><td>MGE-651</td></tr><tr><td>•Final Flavor</td><td>MGE-603</td><td>MGE-603</td></tr><tr><td>•Cigarette Paper</td><td>---</td><td>Current KENT</td></tr><tr><td>•Density</td><td>---</td><td>KENT GOLDEN LIGHTS (Less 2%)</td></tr><tr><td>•Filter Tow</td><td>---</td><td>KENT GOLDEN LIGHTS</td></tr><tr><td>•Plugwrap</td><td>---</td><td>9500 Coresta</td></tr><tr><td>•Tipping</td><td>---</td><td>1100 Coresta MMP*</td></tr><tr><td>•Vent Target</td><td>---</td><td>42-44%</td></tr></table>"
        },
        {
          "label": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.14897798742138366,
            0.7371306731647883,
            0.8470911949685535,
            0.789521778860798
          ],
          "bbox_px": [
            379,
            2420,
            2155,
            2592
          ],
          "order": 12,
          "content": " $ ^{*} $We recommend the micromechanically perforated tipping because this is the only type of tipping with essentially invisible perforations at this high porosity level.\nD. S. R."
        },
